# Double division of exactly representable values

Divides 2.25 by 1.5 to verify native double-precision division for values
exactly representable in f64, producing 1.5.

>>> source
const double_left: double = 2.25
const double_right: double = 1.5

const double_quotient: double = double_left / double_right
print(double_quotient)

<<< stdout
1.5

<<< stderr
